    "caption": "🤖 ChatGPT Can Now Send iMessages\n\nThe new Messages plugin can find conversations, catch up on missed chats, draft replies, and send them through ChatGPT.\n\nIt can check the calendar, suggest free dinner slots, find birthdays in messages, add them to the calendar, and flag chats that look like spam.\n\nThe plugin is available in ChatGPT Work and Codex on desktop. Install it through Plugins, then Public.\n\n📊@tech",
